	"data": "VPainter\n\n3D vertex painting plugin for Godot.\nRepo: <https://github.com/tomankirilov/VPainter>\nLicense: Check repo\nGodot version: 4.x\nStatus: Listed in awesome-godot\n\nWhat It Provides\nPaint directly on 3D mesh vertices in the Godot editor\nColor/property painting on surfaces\n\nRelevance\nDemonstrates direct 3D manipulation in Godot. The painting-on-surfaces pattern could inform how users annotate or color-code thought bubbles in 3D space.\n\nInforms\n[[goal-node-visualization]] — visual…",
